"<p>Enough information has now been obtained to set up a working MLDonkey "
"configuration. Press \"Finish\" below to get things started.</p>"
"<p>Remember, your finished downloads go into the <em>incoming</em> "
"folder under your work folder.</p>"
"<p>Enjoy KMLDonkey!</p>"
